#: ../../tools/genome_nexus_tools.rst:139 38c1edf4c7674544b169f0c8eeccd2c4
msgid "**Name**: ``GenomeNexus_get_canonical_transcript``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/genome_nexus_tools.rst:141 7b8b23ce5a814f76aa60ec4e5cedf58d
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get the canonical transcript for a gene from Genome "
"Nexus (MSK). Returns the Ensembl transcript ID, protein ID, protein "
"length, RefSeq mRNA ID, CCDS ID, HUGO symbol, and Pfam protein domain "
"annotations. Useful for determining the standard transcript to use for "
"variant annotation, and for getting a quick overview of protein domain "
"architecture. Input is a HUGO gene symbol (e.g., 'TP53', 'BRAF', "
"'BRCA1')."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/genome_nexus_tools.rst:145 336de6b37bbd4803ba3fe60a9b935694
msgid ""
"``gene_symbol`` (string) (required) HUGO gene symbol. Examples: 'TP53', "
"'BRAF', 'BRCA1', 'EGFR', 'KRAS'."
msgstr ""

